@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 12 to 15 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.2.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.2.0> ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.1.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1215corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.2.0 (2026-11-26): Revision of the scope stage (a stage may be revised by a stage revision, Lineage Operating Discipline v163.0.7, 3f). Cause: running `backlog_next_act check --all` (framework SHACL 1.229.0, read from the clone updated the same day) on 1.0.0 and 1.1.0 lists rules the stage did not answer: every area needs a location and a counted measure (ScopeAreaShape), every area, deliverable and exclusion a layer (ScopeLayerShape), every deliverable a quoted mission clause (DeliverableProvenanceShape), every exclusion a named concern (ScopeExclusionShape), the scope a list of required deliverables (ScopeContentShape), the mission a decider and a stated outcome (MissionShape, MissionOutcomeShape). Added here: those statements. No mission amendment is made (see the audit note of Scope12). The two rules that wait for later stages (a goal advancing the mission, a goal of each facing, an objective measuring each area) are answered by the goal and objective stages. Measured facts for the area counts are those of 1.0.0 (logs in 08-tooling/lineage12-opening/)."""@en .

ex:Mission12 backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_InFlight .

ex:Excl12_Content backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:excludesConcern "Any change to what chapters 12, 13, 14 and 15 teach, to the four chapters' stories, or to the meaning of an example, except a change a ruling forces (prompt, lambda, a frame that does not parse, an analogy)." ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .
ex:Excl12_ExamWork backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:excludesConcern "Any exam, mock-exam or exam-page work." ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .
ex:Excl12_OtherChapters backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:excludesConcern "Any work on chapters 1 to 11 and 16 to 25: their decks, pages, specs and records." ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .
ex:Excl12_LabMaterials backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:excludesConcern "Any lab library, lab session, lab handout or lab-materials package, including its code matching." ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .
ex:Excl12_Rdodi backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:excludesConcern "Any change to the files under 03-materials/ch12 to ch15/rdodi/ (the research-artifact sets)." ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .

ex:Area12_Conversion backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "08-tooling/ch12-deck/, ch13-deck/, ch14-deck/, ch15-deck/ (today the chapters' own builders, not the generic chapter_deck_build_v2_9_0.py); a spec folder per chapter beside them" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "4 chapters; 0 spec folders for the generic builder today; the 4 decks are built by the 4 per-chapter builders (ch12-deck/deck_build_v2_0_0.py and its three siblings)" .
ex:Area12_Deck backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ;
    backlog:areaLocation "03-materials/ch12/SEN0414_Ch12_CommandLinePrograms_3e_v2_0_0.pptx; ch13/SEN0414_Ch13_WebScraping_3e_v2_0_0.pptx; ch14/SEN0414_Ch14_ExcelSpreadsheets_3e_v2_0_0.pptx; ch15/SEN0414_Ch15_GoogleSheets_3e_v2_0_0.pptx" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "4 decks, 203 slides (48, 51, 51, 53), 165 content slides; deck standard 1.3.0 fails D7 and D10 on all 4; 8 of 165 titles under 4 words (2, 1, 4, 1 per deck); 404 code slides or frames with a prompt marker in the page checks; 2 lambda slides in chapter 12 and 1 in chapter 13; fit check refuses 2 slides (chapter 12 slide 16, chapter 15 slide 34); layout check lists 1 item in chapter 12" .
ex:Area12_Reader backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ;
    backlog:areaLocation "Speaker notes and balloons of the 4 decks listed under the deck area" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "183 of 203 notes outside 60 to 140 words (42 of 48, 45 of 51, 45 of 51, 51 of 53); 205 reader-note findings (52, 53, 51, 49); 147 story-prose findings (28, 42, 42, 35); balloons on code slides not yet counted" .
ex:Area12_NoAnalogies backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ;
    backlog:areaLocation "The 4 decks and the 4 pages (03-materials/ch12/page/ to ch15/page/, newest sen0414_chNN_page_v9_*.html)" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "41 analogy slides in the decks (9, 10, 10, 12), each titled Everyday pictures or marked ANALOGY; 14 analogy words found in the page text of chapters 12 and 13 (6 and 8), 0 in chapters 14 and 15, to be read for what they carry" .
ex:Area12_Page backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ;
    backlog:areaLocation "03-materials/ch12/page/sen0414_ch12_page_v9_97_0.html; ch13/page/sen0414_ch13_page_v9_96_0.html; ch14/page/sen0414_ch14_page_v9_98_0.html; ch15/page/sen0414_ch15_page_v9_97_0.html" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "4 pages at template 9.54.0; 221 code frames (53, 56, 55, 57) of which 221 do not parse because of prompt markers; 552 lambda occurrences in the page text (59, 74, 191, 228); 3 of 53 frames of chapter 12 not found in the page; the full page test on the corrected pipeline not yet run on the 4 pages" .
ex:Area12_PageCode backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ;
    backlog:areaLocation "The Slide code tab and top menu of the 4 pages, and the chapter-code manifests 03-materials/ch12/page/chapter_code_ch12_v1_0_0.json to ch15" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "4 pages; frames equal on slide, page and manifest: not yet measured; the menu item that runs the slide examples in order is held, see the audit note of Scope12" .
ex:Area12_Release backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "08-tooling/ch12-deck/ to ch15-deck/ logs folders and the review records REVIEW_RECORD_chNN_*.md to be written beside them" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "4 chapters; 0 review records of the three roles for these chapters; 0 of 4 chapters with every automatic condition passing (deck standard fails 4 of 4)" .
ex:Area12_OwnVersion backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "All files of 03-materials/ch12 to ch15 and 08-tooling/ch12-* to ch15-* changed by this lineage" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Newest page versions 9.97.0, 9.96.0, 9.98.0, 9.97.0 with older drafts beside them (chapter 12: 9.28.0, 9.95.0, 9.96.0; chapter 13: 9.28.1, 9.28.2, 9.95.0, 9.96.0); version check of the repository exits 0 today" .
