ex:Scope12 backlog:hasAuditNote "Held, not dropped (2026-11-26): clause (e) of the scope text and the labels of the four PageCode deliverables name a top menu item that runs the slide examples in order. The mission of 1.0.0 does not say it, so the scope must not require it (DeliverableProvenanceShape), and a mission is widened only by the Owner's dated ruling recorded as a GovernanceRuling that a shape enforces (MissionAmendmentShape, G216). The ruling of 2026-11-24 is known here only from the Owner's recorded standing rulings, not from the message itself, and it is not in this repository. One question to the Owner is open: confirm the ruling and its wording so it can be recorded and the mission widened. Until then no goal, objective or story requires the menu item; the PageCode deliverables are required only for the code equal on slide, page and manifest." .
